## SECTION 3: CORE ENGINEERING INVARIANTS

### 3.1 Three.js 0.186.1 PBR Shader & Kinematics Pipeline
- **Orbital Solver:** Spring-damper loop (`k = 3.8`, `damping = 0.88`, `dt = 0.01667s`).
- **Repulsion & Zoom:** Bounding-sphere repulsion vectors active down to 20% zoom scale (`targetZoomScale = 0.20`, `bufferUnits = 1.2`, `damping = 0.92`).
- **MeshPhysicalMaterial Uniforms:**
  - `transmission: 0.92` (GPU), `roughness: 0.05`, `ior: 1.6`, `clearcoat: 1.0`, `clearcoatRoughness: 0.1`
  - `depthWrite: false` (MANDATORY on all transparent sphere shells to eliminate Z-fighting against DOM overlays)
  - `clampedEnvMapIntensity: 0.35`
- **Media Decoupling:**
  - **Sphere 01 (CEREBRO HQ [0,0,0]):** `map: null` (strictly no video textures; 100% transmissive shell exposing internal 6,400-particle galaxy, C-core, and cardiac splines).
  - **Child Spheres:** Route vertical video reels (9:16 aspect ratio, 24fps, contain) exclusively to child nodes (`SEVEN`, `Mission Lotus`, `Young & Human`, `El Batron`, `Lovart.ai 39 OS`).

### 3.2 Glassmorphism & CSS 3D Perspective Matrix
- **Void Glass Surface:**
  - `background: rgba(20, 38, 50, 0.88)` (Void Black `#142632` at 88% opacity)
  - `backdrop-filter: blur(20px); -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(20px);`
  - `border: 1px solid rgba(242, 246, 248, 0.12);`
  - `border-radius: 20px;`
- **3D Perspective Wrapper:**
  - Parent container: `perspective: 1200px; transform-style: preserve-3d;`
  - Flanking panels default offset: `transform: rotateX(12deg) rotateY(-8deg) translateZ(40px);`
  - Hover elevation: `translateZ(58px);` (transition: `320ms cubic-bezier(0.22, 1, 0.36, 1)`)

### 3.3 Interactive Tokens & Component Harmonization
- **Geometry:** Micro-pill geometry (`min-height: 36px`, `border-radius: 18px`, min hit target `44×44px`).
- **Glow Rings:** Active state glow rings in Neon Cyan (`#4C8DFF`) and Signal Blue (`#65ACFF`) (`box-shadow: 0 0 0 2px rgba(76, 141, 255, 0.45), 0 0 22px rgba(76, 141, 255, 0.65)`).
- **Floating Cards:** Negative space layouts (`padding: 24px`, `gap: 16px`), hardware-accelerated expand/collapse height animations, z-elevation idle `z-20` -> hover `z-35`.

### 3.4 Spatial Transcription HUD & Fingerless Micro-Keyboard
- **HUD Transcription Pill:** Translucent container (`max-width: 480px`, `backdrop-filter: blur(16px)`, `background: rgba(20, 38, 50, 0.78)`).
- **Word-Sync Stagger:** Words revealed sequentially via `40ms` stagger (`filter: blur(4px) -> 0; opacity: 0 -> 1`) locked to audio timestamps.
- **Fingerless Keyboard:** Frosted circular key tokens (30px diameter, `background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08)`, `border-radius: 9999px`) with live text-input buffering; keys illuminate autonomously (`#9AFFE0` for AI generation, `#4C8DFF` for operator input); no hand-mesh overhead.

### 3.5 Dynamic Layout Engine (`computeGuiLayout`)
- **Reservation Priority:** Header -> Contextual Surface / Phone Sheet -> Voice Dock -> Utility Bar -> Tour Controls.
- **Remaining Viewport:** Allocated directly to `sceneSafeRect` for the Three.js viewport.
- **Collision Tolerance:** Zero overlapping interactive bounding boxes across 390×844, 820×1180, 1180×820, 1440×900, and 2560×1440.

